# =============================================================================
# TravelMate — DEPLOYMENT ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# =============================================================================
# This file contains the complete environment configuration for deploying
# TravelMate to a production server (e.g., Render, Fly.io, AWS, DigitalOcean).
# 
# ⚠️ SECURITY NOTICE: This template contains REAL API KEYS from your dev 
# environment. When deploying to production, it is highly recommended to inject
# these variables securely via your platform's Secrets Manager, rather than 
# committing them directly.
# =============================================================================

